&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to contextualize problems across various audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled at navigating ambiguity and involving the right stakeholders to address issues efficiently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and shipping products to users&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
